    "ari": "65:22:2",
    "name": "Revelation 22:2",
    "verse": "right down the middle of the\nstreet. The Tree of Life was planted on each side of the River, producing\ntwelve kinds of fruit, a ripe fruit each month. The leaves of the Tree are for\nhealing the nations."
